ick=\"document.getElementById('searchform').submit();\" class=\"btn-search\">\n                            <i class=\"fas fa-search\"><span class=\"sr-only\">Search</span></i>\n                        </a>\n                    </form>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"close-btn\">Close</div>\n            <div class=\"overlay-menu\"></div>\n\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n\n\n    <!-- Content - Main\n    ================================ -->\n    <main class=\"content-main\">\n\n                    <div class=\"hero-main\">\n                <div class=\"slider-out\">\n                    <div id=\"hero-main\">\n                        <div class=\"item\">\n                            <video  autoplay muted playsinline>\n                                <source src=\"//media.corporate-ir.net/media_files/IROL/phantompharma/Mountain-range-light-snow-caps_web-banner.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"/>\n                            </video>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"hero-cont\">\n                    <div class=\"container\">\n                        <aside>\n                            <h1>Investors & Media</h1>\n                        </aside>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        \n\n        <!--=== Content - Inner ===-->\n            <div class=\"content-inner\">\n        \n        \n          <div class=\"region region-content\">\n    <div data-drupal-messages-fallback class=\"hidden\"></div>\n\n<div id=\"block-nir-pid3485-content\" class=\"block--system-main-block block--system-main-block--5806 block--content--system-main-block block--content--system-main-block--5806 block--74af6e24-a5d4-4fcc-bed3-f33c0180eee1 block--74af6e24-a5d4-4fcc-bed3-f33c0180eee1--5806 block block-system block-system-main-block\">\n  \n    \n      <article class=\"node node--type-nir_landing_page node--view-mode-full clearfix\">\n  \n      <h1>\n              Investors &amp; Media\n          </h1>\n    \n\n  <div>\n    \n\t<div class=\"idm-container\">\n\t\t<div id=\"ndq-content\" class=\"home_profile_stock\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"idm-row\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"idm-col-sm-12 idm-col-md-8 idm-col-lg-8 idm-mb-5 home-profile\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"block-region-slider\"><div class=\"block-content--nir-global-block block-content--nir-global-block--6116 block--block-contentf390be37-9ad7-4a7e-a354-7aad647bf74c block--block-contentf390be37-9ad7-4a7e-a354-7aad647bf74c--5806 block--slider--block-content--f390be37-9ad7-4a7e-a354-7aad647bf74c block--slider--block-content--f390be37-9ad7-4a7e-a354-7aad647bf74c--5806 block--62a3f554-e81b-4368-97e5-6d45e942029b block--62a3f554-e81b-4368-97e5-6d45e942029b--5806 block block-block-content block-block-contentf390be37-9ad7-4a7e-a354-7aad647bf74c\">\n  \n      <h2>Corporate Profile</h2>\n    \n      \n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-nir-global-block-node field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item\">  \n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-nir-global-block-body field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item\"><p>Phathom Pharmaceuticals is a biopharmaceutical company focused on developing and commercializing novel treatments for gastrointestinal (GI) diseases. We have licensed the exclusive rights in the United States, Europe, and Canada to vonoprazan, a first-in-class potassium-competitive acid blocker (PCAB). The Company has assembled a team of seasoned gastrointestinal and pharmaceutical industry experts with deep expertise in developing GI therapeutics, including anti-secretory agents.</p>\n\n<p>Phathom currently markets VOQUEZNA\u00ae (vonoprazan) tablets for the treatment of heartburn associated with Non-Erosive GERD in adults, the healing and maintenance of healing of Erosive GERD in adults and associated heartburn in adults, in addition to VOQUEZNA\u00ae TRIPLE PAK\u00ae (vonoprazan tablets, amoxicillin capsules, clarithromycin tablets) and VOQUEZNA\u00ae DUAL PAK\u00ae (vonoprazan tablets, amoxicillin capsules) for the treatment of H. pylori infection in adults. In addition, the company is also advancing its development program across multiple acid-related GI disorders, including As Needed dosing for Non-Erosive GERD (NERD) and Eosinophilic Esophagitis (EoE).</p>\n\n<p>For full prescribing and safety information, please visit <a href=\"https://www.voquezna.com/\">VOQUEZNA.com</a></p></div>\n      \n</div>\n      \n  </div>\n</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"idm-col-sm-12 idm-col-md-4 idm-col-lg-4 idm-mb-5 home-stock\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"block-region-slidergutter\"><div data-storage-id=\"node:5806:full:19431\" data-uuid=\"ef6147b4-5c48-4bb5-a249-efadc198f426\" class=\"block--market-data-block__stock-quote block--market-data-block__stock-quote--5806 block--slidergutter--market-data-block__stock-quote block--slidergutter--market-data-block__stock-quote--5806 block--ef6147b4-5c48-4bb5-a249-efadc198f426 block--ef6147b4-5c48-4bb5-a249-efadc198f426--5806 block block-nir-market-data-block block-market-data-block__stock-quote\">\n  \n    \n      <div class='stock-quote stock-quote__short'>\n    <div class=\"quote-wrapper\">\n                                                                            <div>\n                            </div>\n            <span class=\"stock-price \"></span>\n            <span class=\"stock-change \"></span>\n            </div>\n</div>\n  </div>\n\n<div class=\"block--nir-stock-chart block--nir-stock-chart--5806 block--slidergutter--nir-stock-chart block--slidergutter--nir-stock-chart--5806 block--2d8b8c9f-9974-4edb-8dd8-2aa9763feef8 block--2d8b8c9f-9974-4edb-8dd8-2aa9763feef8--5806 block block-nir-stock-chart\">\n  \n    \n      \n<img src=\"https://api.nasdaqomx.wallst.com/api/chart?display=line&symbol=PHAT.O-PHAT&scale=linear&duration=1dy&frequency=15min&gridLine=h&bgColor=ffffff&lineColor=